TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Peki,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} mobilyalarım hakkında ne düşünüyorsun?{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
Güzel.
Şey...

{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Peki,{{TAG:0007:0000:03000000}} dürüst ol.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} Dekorasyonumu nasıl buldun?{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
Havalı!
...Farklı.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}I'm curious.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} What do you think
of the inside of my house,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}?{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
It's lovely.
It's lacking...

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}¡Qué alegría me da oír eso!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Si hay algún mueble que te guste
mucho, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}dímelo y te lo puedo vender.

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Oh, merci beaucoup !{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}Tu sais, s'il y
a quelque chose qui te plaît, dis-le.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
On pourra peut-être s'arranger.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Oh, che gioia le tue parole!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}Se vedi
qualcosa che ti piace,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} dimmelo.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Puoi avere ciò che vuoi!

